# Nothing is needed here. The app calls the API on its own domain (/api).
# In production the Render static site has a Rewrite rule
#   /api/*  ->  https://autofill-blgf.onrender.com/api/*
# (Dashboard > static site > Redirects/Rewrites), and in development
# vite.config.js proxies /api to your local backend.
# VITE_API_URL is no longer read — remove it from the static site's settings.
